OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrests after man found
OL,4,Adead in town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a man in his
OL,8,F40s was found dead.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called in the
OL,11,Fearly hours after the man was found
OL,12,Funresponsive on Astley Gate in
OL,13,FBlackburn town centre.
OL,15,FLancashire Police said the death was
OL,16,Fbeing treated as unexplained and
OL,17,Finquiries into the cause of death were
OL,18,Fongoing.
OL,20,FAs part of their investigation, a man
OL,21,Fin his 20s and a woman in her 30s have
OL,22,Fbeen arrested and remain in custody.
